# All keys are optional. With none set, Gully Guessr runs in zero-key Open Mode
# (Wikimedia Commons street photography + a verified local fallback pool).

# Tier 1 — Google Street View (full 360° navigation everywhere Street View exists in India).
# Enable "Maps JavaScript API" (and optionally "Geocoding API") for this key.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Tier 2 — Mapillary free 360° panoramas. Create a client token at
# https://www.mapillary.com/dashboard/developers
VITE_MAPILLARY_ACCESS_TOKEN=
